		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "da168d65-deeb-4780-9873-2557786fafb4")
		(at 274 91 90)
		(descr "Ebyte E07-900MM10S (CC1101) and E22-900MM22S (SX1262), 10.0 x 10.0 mm LCC, 20 castellated pads at 1.27 mm. Pad drawing identical in E07-M DS v1.0 3.1 (pdf p.7) and E22-900MM22S DS ch. 3 (pdf p.5): first pad 2.46 mm from the corner, module pad 0.75 x 0.80 mm with a 0.40 mm half hole. Land 0.8 x 1.7 mm: 0.8 mm under the module, 0.9 mm outside the body for hand soldering. No copper under the module except the top GND pour (E07 DS 4.1): the rule area keeps tracks out, vias and pours are allowed.")
